  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"705\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">דַּי לִי בְּפַת,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמַיִם טִפַּת.</span></p><p data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"705\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נָתַתָּ? תּוֹדָה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- אֶרְצֶה גַּם דָּגָה.</span></p><p data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"705\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמִי יַאֲכִילֵנוּ בָּשָׂר?<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמִי יַלְבִּישֵׁנוּ הָדָר?</span></p><p data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"705\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">זָכַרְנוּ אֶת טַעַם הֶחָצִיל,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַשּׁוּם, הַבָּצָל הֶחָצִיר.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p style=\"clear: both;\">אִם עוֹלֶה בְּךָ “<b>עוֹד</b>” - אַחֲרֵי שֶׁכְּבָר אָמַרְתָּ \"<b>מַסְפִּיק</b>\",<br />עֲצֹר רֶגַע.</p><p style=\"clear: both;\">נַסֵּה לְהוֹדוֹת עַל מָה שֶׁיֵּשׁ - לִפְנֵי שֶׁאַתָּה מְבַקֵּשׁ עוֹד.</p><p style=\"clear: both;\">לֹא כְּדֵי לְוַתֵּר עַל הָרָצוֹן,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֶלָּא כְּדֵי שֶׁלֹּא הוּא יְנַהֵל אוֹתְךָ.</span></p></span><p style=\"text-align: right;\"></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; text-align: -webkit-center;\">\"וְגַם הַנֶּפֶשׁ לֹא תִמָּלֵא\" (קהלת ו' ז)</span></span></p><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2></span><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"וַיְהִי הָעָם כְּמִתְאֹנְנִים ... וַיִּשְׁמַע ה' ... וַתִּבְעַר בָּם אֵשׁ ה' וַתֹּאכַל בִּקְצֵה הַמַּחֲנֶה\"</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מיהם \"קצה המחנה\"?<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span>\"</span></span><span face=\"sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122;\">רַבִּי שִׁמְעוֹן בֶּן מְנַסְיָא אוֹמֵר: בַּקְּצִינִים שֶׁבָּהֶם וּבַגְּדוֹלִים\" (רש\"י)</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"בִּקְצֵה הַמַּחֲנֶה\" = 305 = הקצינים (בעל הטורים)</span></p></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></b></i></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><b><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></b></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span>'</span><span><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">קְצֵה</span></b></i>' / '</span><span><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">בִּסְיָפֵי</span></b></i>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span>❖ גבול - סוף</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span>'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">וַיִּצְעַק</span></b></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">וּצְוַח</span></b></i>'</span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span>&nbsp;צעקה - צווחה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>'</span><span><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">תַּבְעֵרָה</span></b></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">דְּלֵיקְתָא</span></b></i>'</span><br /></span><span>❖ אש - דליקה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span>'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">תַּאֲוָה</span></b></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">שְׁאֵילְתָא</span></b></i>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span>&nbsp;בקשה מתמשכת - שאלה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">כְּלָאֵם</span></b></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><span style=\"color: #222222; font-style: normal;\">אַסְרִנּוּן</span></b></i>'</span><br /></span><span>❖ עצירה, סגירה - מאסר</span></span></li></ol><div><br /></div><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><br /></div></span></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/9420cec77f003d8508.png\" style=\"clear: right; float: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 1em;\"><img alt=\"איור של מסך צ’אט המדמה אפליקציית הזמנות: תחילה הודעה “ההזמנה הושלמה: לחם ומים”, אחריה בקשה להוסיף דגים, ולבסוף בקשה להוסיף גם בשר והדר\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"208\" data-original-width=\"364\" height=\"114\" src=\"/assets/images/content/9420cec77f003d8508.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></div><br />"
